# Quick manual checks. Works in VS Code (REST Client), Visual Studio and Rider.
@host = http://localhost:8080

### Build metadata
GET {{host}}/api/v1/meta

### Liveness (process only)
GET {{host}}/health/live

### Readiness (includes the database)
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### OpenAPI document
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json

### List users
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users?limit=20

### Create a user
POST {{host}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "displayName": "Ada Lovelace"
}

### Create a user - invalid payload, expect 400 problem+json
POST {{host}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "displayName": ""
}
